---
import { ArrowRight } from 'lucide-react';
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
import Capture from './Capture';
import { captureImage } from '@/lib/captures';
import lineage from '@/assets/captures/current-lineage.png';
const image = await captureImage(lineage);
---

<section class="provenance not-content" aria-labelledby="provenance">
	<SectionHeading id="provenance" label="Follow the evidence" title="A result has" emphasis="a history." />
	<p class="intro">Open an artifact’s <strong>Lineage</strong> tab to follow its recorded inputs, producing actions and outputs. The graph stays with the file, alongside its preview and version history.</p>
	<Capture client:visible image={image}
		alt="CLIO artifact provenance graph connecting bike-stations.csv through Used and Generated edges to station-balance.csv and morning-findings.md"
		caption="Synthetic worked example: the source branches into balance, availability and capacity checks, then joins in the report. The tools recorded the declared input relationships and hashed file versions. Missing relationships are not inferred."
		sizes="(min-width: 80rem) 76rem, 100vw" />
	<ol class="reading-guide">
		<li><strong>Start at the source.</strong><span>Find the input file and the version used for this result.</span></li>
		<li><strong>Follow the action.</strong><span>Used leads into a recorded action; Generated leads to its output.</span></li>
		<li><strong>Inspect the file.</strong><span>Open a related artifact, compare versions, or export its evidence.</span></li>
	</ol>
	<a class="more" href="/docs/evidence/#follow-artifact-lineage">Read the lineage walkthrough <ArrowRight aria-hidden="true" size={16} /></a>
</section>

<style>
	.provenance { padding-block: 3rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
	.intro { max-width: 65ch; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.65; margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem; }
	.reading-guide { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 0; margin: 1.5rem 0; list-style: none; counter-reset: step; }
	li { counter-increment: step; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
	li::before { content: '0' counter(step); display: block; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: .8rem; color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: .5rem; }
	strong { color: var(--ink); }
	li span { display: block; color: var(--muted); margin-top: .35rem; font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.5; }
	.more { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
	.more:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
	@media (min-width: 50rem) { .reading-guide { grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); } }
</style>
